+- 1 configuration, 81 ordinary syntax declarations, 39 function
+  declarations, 88 non-opaque total-function declarations, and 22 opaque
+  total symbols;
+- 5 contexts, 656 ordinary rules, 45 priority rules, and 2 simplification
